# The GitHub Actions configs keep their own consistent 4-space
# convention; letting prettier reflow them churns every cross-PR merge
# on workflow files (this repo edits ci.yml frequently). actionlint and
# shellcheck still scan these paths — only prettier is turned off here
# (qlty triage does not apply to formatter runs, so the ignore file is
# the mechanism prettier itself honors).
.github/**

# project.yml here is a hand-maintained XcodeGen spec, not CLI output:
# ADR-033 §5 names its info.properties the canonical iOS Info.plist overlay,
# and _build-tauri-apple.yml calls it the source of truth for regenerating
# project.pbxproj. tauri-cli only creates the scaffold when the file is
# absent; bundle.iOS.template is not set in tauri.conf.json. Prettier must
# not be the last writer of this hand-edited tree — format-only diffs here
# are noise on iOS-config PRs. Exclude the whole Xcode scaffold.
tauri/gen/**
